Unlike clone, which must return exactly Self, to_owned can return anything you could borrow a &Self from: the Owned type must implement Borrow<Self>. You can borrow a &[T] from a Vec<T>, so [T] can implement ToOwned<Owned=Vec<T>>, as long as T implements Clone,

